Q1.
Predict the output.

Code:
class Box {
    int v;

    Box(int v) {
        this.v = v;
    }
}

static void swap(Box a, Box b) {
    Box t = a;
    a = b;
    b = t;
}

// inside main
Box x = new Box(1);
Box y = new Box(2);

swap(x, y);

System.out.println(x.v + " " + y.v);

A. 2 1
B. 1 2
C. 1 1
D. Compilation error


